# Project Handoff — LG ThinQ LECCP BLE Wake-Up Reverse Engineering

**Purpose:** Resume this project in a future ChatGPT conversation, OpenCode session, or a combination of both.

## Project goal

Understand how the LG ThinQ Android app wakes an LG webOS television from standby using Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE), then determine whether the relevant behaviour can be reproduced from Linux and integrated with Home Assistant.

The target TV is an **LG 32LM637BPLA running webOS 4.10**. The ThinQ app reliably wakes it from standby.

This is an investigation, not a commitment to build or deploy a solution.

